# Input
```astro
---
---
<!-- should generate diagnostics -->

<!-- invalid boolean value -->
<div aria-hidden="yes">content</div>

<!-- invalid tristate value -->
<span aria-checked="test">some text</span>

<!-- invalid static template value -->
<button aria-pressed=`yes`>Button</button>

<!-- escaped interpolation is static text -->
<button aria-pressed=`\${view}`>Button</button>

```

